{"verses":[{"verse":1,"text":"\\nd Bwana\\nd* ni nuru yangu na wokovu wangu,"},{"verse":2,"text":"Waovu watakaposogea dhidi yangu"},{"verse":3,"text":"Hata jeshi linizunguke pande zote,"},{"verse":4,"text":"Jambo moja ninamwomba \\nd Bwana\\nd*,"},{"verse":5,"text":"Kwa kuwa siku ya shida,"},{"verse":6,"text":"Kisha kichwa changu kitainuliwa"},{"verse":7,"text":"Isikie sauti yangu nikuitapo, Ee \\nd Bwana\\nd*,"},{"verse":8,"text":"Moyo wangu unasema kuhusu wewe,"},{"verse":9,"text":"Usinifiche uso wako,"},{"verse":10,"text":"Hata kama baba yangu na mama wakiniacha,"},{"verse":11,"text":"Nifundishe njia yako, Ee \\nd Bwana\\nd*,"},{"verse":12,"text":"Usiniachilie kwa nia za adui zangu,"},{"verse":13,"text":"Nami bado nina tumaini hili:"},{"verse":14,"text":"Mngojee \\nd Bwana\\nd*,"}]}